# qt adds to the TODAY project, and the Today view lists its tasks, an undated one too.
file <<END
TODAY:
Work:
	- Report @due({today})
END
keys gt
see - Report  Work
keys qt
type Undated chore
keys <Enter>
status Added to TODAY
see - Undated chore  TODAY
quit
saved <<END
TODAY:
	- Undated chore
Work:
	- Report @due({today})
END
